{"seq":1,"slug":"roofline-arithmetic-intensity","title":"Roofline 模型、算术强度与瓶颈判定方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/roofline-profiling-multigpu-portability/roofline-arithmetic-intensity","wordCount":2502,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"roofline-模型-算术强度与瓶颈判定方法\">Roofline 模型、算术强度与瓶颈判定方法</h1><p>你写了一个 kernel，比参考实现快了 3 倍，却不知道还能不能再快 10 倍；或者换个 shape 就从 200 µs 跳到 900 µs，说不清是被算力还是显存带宽卡住。Roofline 模型就是回答这类问题的工具：它把 kernel 的<strong>算术强度</strong>（每读写一字节 DRAM 能做多少次浮点运算）和硬件的<strong>两条峰值线</strong>（峰值算力、峰值带宽）画在同一张双对数图上，一眼判定理论天花板在哪、距离天花板还差多少。这篇讲清模型的数学、ridge point 的算法，以及如何用 Nsight Compute 把实测数据落到这张图上——这是后续所有 profiling 与调优决策的坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条极限线与算术强度\">核心概念：两条极限线与算术强度</h2><p>Roofline 由 Williams、Waterman 与 Patterson 在 2009 年 CACM 论文中提出（<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/1498765.1498785\">https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/1498765.1498785</a> ），最初面向多核 CPU，后被 NVIDIA 与 AMD 采纳为 GPU 性能分析的标准框架，Nsight Compute 的 Roofline 视图与 AMD ROCm Profiler 都直接实现它。核心只有两个变量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>算术强度</strong>（Arithmetic Intensity，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>）：kernel 完成的总浮点运算量除以它访问 DRAM 的总字节数，单位是 FLOP/Byte。注意分母是 <strong>DRAM 流量</strong>，不是 kernel 声明的数据量——L2 命中的读取不算进分母。</li>\n<li><strong>可达性能</strong>（Attainable Performance，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>）：在给定算力上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 与带宽上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 取下界：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>β</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min\\left(\\pi,\\; I \\times \\beta\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 当横轴、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 当纵轴取双对数坐标，就得到一条「先斜后平」的折线：斜段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I\\times\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 代表<strong>带宽受限</strong>（bandwidth-bound），平段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 代表<strong>算力受限</strong>（compute-bound）。转折点称为 <strong>ridge point</strong>，其横坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^{\\ast} = \\pi/\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>。判定逻辑表（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 以 FP32 无量纲计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 为峰值 DRAM 带宽）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>典型算术强度</th>\n<th>H100 SXM 上的归属</th>\n<th>首要优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐元素 <code>y = a*x + b</code></td>\n<td>~0.17 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>极端带宽受限</td>\n<td>与前后算子融合，减少中间张量往返</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LayerNorm / softmax</td>\n<td>~1-3</td>\n<td>带宽受限</td>\n<td>单趟归约（online softmax），避免两遍读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稠密 GEMM <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M{=}N{=}K{=}4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4096</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2730</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3 \\cdot 4096 \\approx 2730</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2730</span></span></span></span></span>（理想）</td>\n<td>算力受限</td>\n<td>用 tensor core、TF32/FP16、更好的分块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大 GEMM 实测（含 spill）</td>\n<td>数百至上千</td>\n<td>视分块质量而定</td>\n<td>提升 shared memory 复用，减少重复读</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有个反直觉的事实：GEMM 的<strong>理想</strong>算术强度极高（每个元素读一次、参与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次乘加），理论上是算力受限；但它<strong>实测</strong>的算术强度可能只有理想的几分之一——因为分块不当，A/B 矩阵被反复从 DRAM 拉进来。Roofline 用<strong>实测 DRAM 字节</strong>而非「数据有多大」来算分母，于是分块质量直接反映在横坐标的位置上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ridge-point-把硬件折算成一条阈值线\">Ridge Point：把硬件折算成一条阈值线</h2><p>Ridge point 是整个模型里唯一需要记住的常数，它把两颗芯片的全部差异压缩成一个 FLOP/Byte 阈值。下表用 2024–2026 年主流数据中心 GPU 的公开规格算出各自 ridge（算力取<strong>稠密</strong>值，不含 sparsity 翻倍；带宽取峰值 HBM）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<th>峰值带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>峰值算力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>（精度）</th>\n<th>Ridge <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^\\ast=\\pi/\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A100 80GB</td>\n<td>2039 GB/s</td>\n<td>19.5 TFLOPS（FP32 非张量）</td>\n<td>~9.6 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>NVIDIA A100 datasheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H100 SXM5</td>\n<td>3.35 TB/s</td>\n<td>67 TFLOPS（FP32 非张量）</td>\n<td>~20 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>NVIDIA H100 datasheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H100 SXM5</td>\n<td>3.35 TB/s</td>\n<td>989 TFLOPS（FP16/BF16 张量）</td>\n<td>~295 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B200</td>\n<td>8 TB/s</td>\n<td>2250 TFLOPS（FP16/BF16 张量）</td>\n<td>~281 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>NVIDIA Blackwell B200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B200</td>\n<td>8 TB/s</td>\n<td>4500 TFLOPS（FP8 张量）</td>\n<td>~560 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD MI300X</td>\n<td>5.3 TB/s</td>\n<td>1307 TFLOPS（FP16 张量）</td>\n<td>~247 FLOP/Byte</td>\n<td>AMD Instinct MI300X</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数字来源：NVIDIA H100 datasheet（<a href=\"https://resources.nvidia.com/en-us-hopper-architecture/nvidia-h100-tensor-c\">https://resources.nvidia.com/en-us-hopper-architecture/nvidia-h100-tensor-c</a> ）、NVIDIA DGX B200 / Blackwell 页面（<a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/data-center/dgx-b200/\">https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/data-center/dgx-b200/</a> ）、AMD Instinct MI300X 产品页（<a href=\"https://www.amd.com/en/products/accelerators/instinct/mi300/mi300x.html\">https://www.amd.com/en/products/accelerators/instinct/mi300/mi300x.html</a> ）。规格随功耗档位与时钟漂移，做容量规划时以本地 <code>ncu</code> 读到的实际峰值时钟为准。</p>\n<p>两个工程结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>精度决定 ridge 的量级</strong>。同一块 H100，FP32 非张量的 ridge 只有 20，FP16 张量却有 295，差了近 15 倍。一个算术强度为 30 的 kernel，用 FP32 CUDA core 跑是算力受限，改用 FP16 tensor core 后立刻变成带宽受限——瓶颈换了地方，优化手段也必须跟着换。</li>\n<li><strong>代际提升主要来自张量核心，不是带宽</strong>。H100→B200 算力与带宽各涨约 2.3–2.4 倍，张量 ridge 持平在 ~280–560；但非张量路径的 ridge 始终在 20 上下。ridge 还会随降精度、指令选择、访问模式（随机 vs 连续）、ECC 而浮动：<strong>算 ridge 用 datasheet，判瓶颈用 <code>ncu</code> 实测值</strong>——两者差 20% 以上说明有别的因素在起作用。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个必须警惕的陷阱是 <strong>FLOP 计数方式</strong>：一个 FMA 计 2 FLOP 还是 1，直接让算术强度翻倍或减半。Tensor core 指令按硬件吞吐折算，与手写 FMA 口径不同，跨实现比较务必确认口径一致——这是 roofline 误报最常见的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-nsight-compute-实测瓶颈-sol-百分比\">用 Nsight Compute 实测瓶颈：SOL 百分比</h2><p>理论 ridge 给的是「应该受限在哪」，<code>ncu</code> 给的是「实际受限在哪」。Nsight Compute 的 Speed-of-Light（SOL）与 Roofline 分析是落地工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 完整 roofline + SOL（重放 kernel 多次，开销大）&#10;ncu --set full -k regex:my_kernel --launch-count 1 ./my_app&#10;# 只看 roofline 与内存/计算两段 SOL，快很多&#10;ncu --section SpeedOfLight --section MemoryWorkloadAnalysis \\&#10;    --section ComputeWorkloadAnalysis ./my_app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整 roofline + SOL（重放 kernel 多次，开销大）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ncu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> full</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -k</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> regex:my_kernel</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --launch-count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./my_app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只看 roofline 与内存/计算两段 SOL，快很多</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ncu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --section</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> SpeedOfLight</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --section</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MemoryWorkloadAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --section</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ComputeWorkloadAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./my_app</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要读的指标是那些 <strong><code>pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed</code></strong> 结尾的百分比（官方指标命名，见 Nsight Compute Profiling Guide，<a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/ProfilingGuide/\">https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/ProfilingGuide/</a> ）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>判读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sm__throughput...pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed</code></td>\n<td>SM 各流水线中最忙的一条占峰值比例</td>\n<td>接近 100% → 计算路径饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dram__throughput...pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed</code></td>\n<td>DRAM 带宽占用率</td>\n<td>&gt;80% → 带宽受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>l1tex__throughput</code> / <code>lts__throughput</code></td>\n<td>L1/纹理 与 L2 吞吐</td>\n<td>定位缓存层瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sm__warps_active...pct_of_peak_sustained_active</code></td>\n<td>达成占用率</td>\n<td>低且算力受限 → 提占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>smsp__inst_executed.sum</code></td>\n<td>实际发射指令数</td>\n<td>对比理论 FLOP，评估指令效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定规则很直接：<strong><code>dram__throughput</code> 接近 100% 而 <code>sm__throughput</code> 不高 → 带宽受限；反之 → 算力受限</strong>。若两者都只有 30–40%，那既不是算力也不是带宽，而是<strong>延迟没有藏住</strong>——用 Little&#39;s 定律检查在途字节：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>inflight</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>latency</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{inflight}} = \\beta \\times L_{\\text{latency}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inflight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">latency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>H100 上一次全局加载延迟约 400–600 周期，要维持 3.35 TB/s 的带宽，需要同时在途数 KB 级的请求量。在途字节不足，占用率再高也喂不饱 DRAM——这是「高占用率但低带宽利用率」的典型成因。Memory Workload Analysis 段会给出各级缓存命中率与理论/实测带宽对比，用于确认这一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级化-roofline-为什么-dram-不是唯一的屋顶\">层级化 Roofline：为什么 DRAM 不是唯一的屋顶</h2><p>单层 roofline 只画 DRAM 一条带宽线，但真实 GPU 有多级存储层次（见 <a href=\"../simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing\">显存层级与合并访问</a>）。若 kernel 经精心分块把绝大部分流量挡在 shared memory 或 L2，其<strong>实测算术强度会远高于按「数据多大」估算的理想值</strong>，此时拿 DRAM roofline 判定会严重低估上限。正确做法是画<strong>多级 roofline</strong>：每级存储各画一条带宽线，取所有线的下包络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;kernel 的访存模式&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;主要流量落在哪一级?&quot;}&#10;    B -- &quot;寄存器/SMEM&quot; --&gt; C[&quot;屋顶 = SM 算力 π&lt;br/&gt;带宽线取 SMEM 带宽&quot;]&#10;    B -- &quot;L2&quot; --&gt; D[&quot;屋顶 = L2 带宽 × I&lt;br/&gt;通常介于两者之间&quot;]&#10;    B -- &quot;DRAM&quot; --&gt; E[&quot;屋顶 = DRAM 带宽 × I&lt;br/&gt;标准 roofline&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;Nsight Compute&lt;br/&gt;Roofline 视图分 L1/L2/DRAM 三条&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;取最紧的一条作为&lt;br/&gt;该 kernel 的真实上限&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"kernel 的访存模式\"] --&gt; B{\"主要流量落在哪一级?\"}\n    B -- \"寄存器/SMEM\" --&gt; C[\"屋顶 = SM 算力 π&lt;br/&gt;带宽线取 SMEM 带宽\"]\n    B -- \"L2\" --&gt; D[\"屋顶 = L2 带宽 × I&lt;br/&gt;通常介于两者之间\"]\n    B -- \"DRAM\" --&gt; E[\"屋顶 = DRAM 带宽 × I&lt;br/&gt;标准 roofline\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"Nsight Compute&lt;br/&gt;Roofline 视图分 L1/L2/DRAM 三条\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"取最紧的一条作为&lt;br/&gt;该 kernel 的真实上限\"]</pre><p>多级 roofline 的收益在于<strong>匹配</strong>。以 shared memory tiling 的 GEMM 为例：DRAM roofline 告诉你还需要更高数据复用，L2/smem roofline 则告诉你当前分块是否已把复用做到片上存储的极限。若 smem roofline 已接近，再调 <code>BLOCK</code> 也无效，该换 tensor core 或降精度；若还差很远，说明 tiling 逻辑本身有问题。这套判断直接指导 <a href=\"../cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-tiling-reduction-scan-patterns\">CUDA tiling 与规约模式</a> 的调参方向，也是 <a href=\"../triton-python-kernel-compilation/triton-autotuning-compiler-pipeline\">Triton autotune</a> 在搜 <code>BLOCK_*</code> 与 <code>num_stages</code> 时背后隐含的目标函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多-gpu-与跨厂商可移植性下的-roofline\">多 GPU 与跨厂商可移植性下的 Roofline</h2><p>同一段 kernel 代码在不同厂商、不同代际的加速器上跑，roofline 图<strong>必须重画</strong>。原因是四个量同时变了：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^\\ast</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，以及最隐蔽的——<strong>编译产物</strong>。</p>\n<p>CUDA、HIP（AMD）、SYCL（Intel）共享同一套 roofline 数学，但峰值口径不同。AMD MI300X 的 FP16 张量算力按 <code>Matrix Core</code> 口径给出，与 NVIDIA <code>Tensor Core</code> 在指令粒度、累加精度、稀疏支持上并不一一对应；把两家 TFLOPs 填进同一张表比较会得出错误结论。可移植层的正确用法是：<strong>用统一高层语言（如 Triton，<a href=\"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton\">https://github.com/triton-lang/triton</a> ）写一次，在每个目标上分别测 ridge、分别定位瓶颈</strong>。Triton 的 <code>@triton.autotune</code> 必须在每个目标上重跑搜索，正是因为它面对不同的 ridge 与 layout 决策——缓存里的最优配置跨不了硬件边界。</p>\n<p>多 GPU 场景（单机多卡或跨节点）还引入一条 roofline 之外的上限：<strong>通信</strong>。张量并行的 all-reduce、流水线并行的激活传输走 NVLink/NVSwitch 或 InfiniBand，有效带宽远低于 HBM。做容量估算时把通信字节并进算术强度的分母，得到的有效 ridge 会显著抬升——这解释了为什么通信密集的并行策略在规模上去后「算力利用率」永远上不去：瓶颈根本不在 SM 或 DRAM 上。同理，换 tensor core 或降精度会把 ridge 大幅抬升（更易滑向算力受限），而算子融合与增大分块则压低 ridge（本质上是在提升有效带宽）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Roofline 核心是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min(\\pi, I\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：算术强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>（实测 FLOP/Byte）与硬件 ridge <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^\\ast=\\pi/\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>。左段带宽受限、右段算力受限；<strong>分母必须是实测 DRAM 流量</strong>，不是「数据有多大」。</li>\n<li>Ridge 把硬件压缩成一个阈值：H100 上 FP32 非张量约 20 FLOP/Byte，FP16 张量约 295；B200 的 FP8 张量约 560。精度决定量级。</li>\n<li>用 <code>ncu --set full</code> 采集 SOL 百分比：<code>dram__throughput</code> 高 → 带宽受限；<code>sm__throughput</code> 高 → 算力受限；两者都低 → 延迟未藏住，查在途字节。</li>\n<li>真实 GPU 有层级，<strong>用多级 roofline（L1/L2/DRAM 多条线取下包络）</strong>；Nsight Compute 的 Roofline 视图已按级拆分。</li>\n<li>跨厂商/跨代际时 ridge 与编译产物都会变，<strong>每张卡重测</strong>；多 GPU 还要把通信字节计入分母，NVLink/IB 带宽才是新上限。</li>\n<li>一句话记忆：<strong>Roofline 不告诉你最优解，它告诉你天花板在哪、以及你离天花板还差几个量级</strong>——先确认没贴着天花板，再决定优化哪个方向。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Roofline 模型、算术强度与瓶颈判定方法","id":"roofline-模型-算术强度与瓶颈判定方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条极限线与算术强度","id":"核心概念-两条极限线与算术强度"},{"level":2,"text":"Ridge Point：把硬件折算成一条阈值线","id":"ridge-point-把硬件折算成一条阈值线"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Nsight Compute 实测瓶颈：SOL 百分比","id":"用-nsight-compute-实测瓶颈-sol-百分比"},{"level":2,"text":"层级化 Roofline：为什么 DRAM 不是唯一的屋顶","id":"层级化-roofline-为什么-dram-不是唯一的屋顶"},{"level":2,"text":"多 GPU 与跨厂商可移植性下的 Roofline","id":"多-gpu-与跨厂商可移植性下的-roofline"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Triton 对比 CUDA：调试手段、性能陷阱与能力边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/triton-python-kernel-compilation/triton-vs-cuda-debugging-pitfalls"},"next":{"title":"Nsight Compute 指标解读与 profiling 优化闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/roofline-profiling-multigpu-portability/ncu-profiling-metrics-loop"}}